<title>USA: North Bancshares buys back 33,000 shares.</title>
<headline>North Bancshares buys back 33,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Bancshares Inc said Monday it has repurchased 33,000 shares of stock since it announced its seventh stock repurchase program on January 21, 1997.</p>
<p>At that time, the holding company for North Federal Savings Bank said it intended to repurchase 100,000 shares, or about 9.5 percent of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
